    "body": "So, given all that has been said above, and the [following comment](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/16684#issuecomment-501964528) on this topic, the following statement/question should be the other way around, right?\n> If I am not implementing a 2D digital artist pen paint application, nor a VR application, but a regular game-type WebGL application, should I look at using desynchronized?",
